王齊王另存候選，不強與其他王同指或斷為異人。孟賁烏獲是比擬人物，不作在場者；紂為引古。擬議秦楚太子質子與秦女婚姻保留未解。","surfaces":["齊王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p031","quote":"「凡天下而以信約從親相堅者蘇秦，封武安君，相燕，即陰與燕王謀伐破齊而分其地；乃詳有罪出走入齊，齊王因受而相之；居二年而覺，齊王大怒，車裂蘇秦於市。夫以一詐偽之蘇秦，而欲經營天下，混一諸侯，其不可成亦明矣。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p031","text":"「凡天下而以信約從親相堅者蘇秦，封武安君，相燕，即陰與燕王謀伐破齊而分其地；乃詳有罪出走入齊，齊王因受而相之；居二年而覺，齊王大怒，車裂蘇秦於市。夫以一詐偽之蘇秦，而欲經營天下，混一諸侯，其不可成亦明矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004117","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004118","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004118","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m031-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004085","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-070","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang","source":{"title":"史記／卷070","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷070","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷070&oldid=2621148","revision_id":2621148,"accessed_